# All files are tracked with regular Git; no LFS required.
# Event logs are stored gzip-compressed (~13% of original size) to fit
# comfortably within standard GitHub repository limits.

# Normalize line endings
* text=auto eol=lf

# Text types
*.csv text
*.md text
*.py text
*.yml text
*.yaml text
*.cff text
*.ipynb text

# Binary types
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
*.csv.gz binary
